## Output Format (Strict JSON)
Return a JSON array of objects. 
- If nothing important is found, return an empty list `[]`.
- Do NOT repeat information already found in "EXISTING MEMORIES" or "MULTI-SOURCE CONTEXT".

```json
[
  {
    "type": "user|feedback|project|reference",
    "tier": "strategic",
    "utility_score": 0.95,
    "rationale": "Reason why this is a unique strategic delta",
    "title": "Short descriptive title",
    "content": "The actual knowledge being recorded",
    "context": "Brief context of the discussion"
  }
]
```
